Hi,

Akima is a part of gnu scientific library, which is on GPL licence. I have tested that function with that of aspline in akima (R), and results were similar. But yes, gsl is external, so final package will still have external dependencies. Although it would be a lot easier to write wrappers (.Call) for gsl in R, than rewriting the whole library.

Abhirup Mallik
Doctoral Student,
School of Statistics,
University of Minnesota

